# Stage1: public Settings intent, existing controls, and unchanged fixture UI.
fold open
rotate portrait
shell am start -a android.settings.DISPLAY_SETTINGS
expect Display
shot speed-display-unfolded
# Reset only our fictional fixture so a prior activity cannot retain its old intent.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es mail bundled
expect 4 messages bundled
expect Combined handoff complete.
shot speed-fixture-unfolded
fold folded
expect 4 messages bundled
shot speed-fixture-cover
[phone] With --timing, open settings:display, settings:sound, settings:wifi, settings:bluetooth, settings:battery, settings:storage and settings:apps. Verify actual destination and foreground package, without changing any values. Record each PASS/FAIL/unsupported.
[phone] Compare old and new Settings navigation, fixture navigation, and offscreen/absent-label searches with matched start state and verification. Record wall time, service/read times, scroll count, model turns and retries; no10x claim until measured.
[phone] Repeated-page and terminal-list search stops early; reverse search still finds a control above the start. Verify original app returns when work ends; no sensitive actions.
[phone] Check pause, lock/sleep, owner takeover, pending approvals, background unavailable and wrong-app refusal; do not change security permissions or bypass a pause.
